2026-07-27T11:55:10.7962521Z i /tmp/RtmpnNvbsY/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7962888Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7963312Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7963679Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7964254Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7965121Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:55:10.7966111Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
